{"step_index":1448,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T22:48:00Z","content":"The user experience and layout architecture across the platform have been upgraded with an executive format and clean aesthetic:\n\n---\n\n### Key UX & Formatting Upgrades\n\n1. **Split-Screen Optical & Neural Diagnostic Studio (Tab 1)**\n   - **Queue Navigator (Left Column):** Filterable unit list (`All Units`, `Defects Only`, `Passed Units`, `Uncertain / Novel`) with status indicators.\n   - **Multi-Modal Diagnostic Viewer (Right Column):**\n     - Tabbed inspection modes: **Bounding Box**, **Grad-CAM Heatmap**, **Industrial Clean**, and **Raw Sensor Frame**.\n     - Real-time confidence bar, spatial ROI pixel coordinates, and class probability distribution readout.\n     - **Automated Routing Prescription Card** indicating whether to divert the unit to Rework, release it to the shipping line, or hold for QA review.\n   - **Telemetry Analytics Log:** Defect breakdown donut chart, unit telemetry log table, and batch drift tracking.\n\n2. **SCADA Production Flow & Conveyor Dynamics (Tab 2)**\n   - **Particle Conveyor Simulation:** Real-time canvas simulation showing part flows with pulsing red constraint nodes based on Arena simulation data.\n   - **Theory of Constraints Breakdown:** Metric chips, WIP buffer estimations (Little's Law), and side-by-side capacity utilization and queue time charts.\n\n3. **Priority-Filtered Root Cause Analysis Matrix (Tab 3)**\n   - **Evidence Priority Filters:** Instantly isolate *High Confidence* or *Medium/High* causal links.\n   - **Prescriptive Action Cards:** Clean telemetry evidence badges with dedicated industrial intervention steps.\n   - **Two-Column Drift & OOD Review:** Side-by-side Batch Drift Trajectory vs. Out-of-Distribution boundary detection.\n\n4. **3D Financial Optimization & What-If Studio (Tab 4)**\n   - **Executive Loss Waterfall:** Economic breakdown of gross revenue, scrap losses, bottleneck idle costs, and net margins.\n   - **Interactive 3D Plotly Surface Plot:** Visualizes net margin response across both scrap reduction and downtime improvements simultaneously.\n   - **Instant What-If Comparison:** Dynamic margin lift metrics and delta comparison charts.\n\n5. **Pure-Python Neural Metamodel Digital Twin (Tab 5)**\n   - **Vectorized MATLAB ANN Surrogate Engine:** Sub-millisecond forward-pass predictions without needing stochastic simulation runs.\n   - **Prescriptive Capacity Optimizer & Sweep Curves:** Identifies input operating setpoints to maximize line throughput while preventing bottleneck starvation/overload."}
